    "text": "Share:\nDifference Makers Gala\nDifference Makers Gala, 5:30 to 10 p.m., Kings Creek Country Club, Rehoboth Beach. Honoring Matt Haley Trust, Lewes Public Library, Hattie Bull, and Waynne Paskins. Dinner, silent auction, DJ, dancing, cost is $125 per person. For tickets or sponsorship go to sdarj.org.\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 10/25/2025 - 5:30pm to 10:00pm",
